  "description": "Seo-Yoon Han is desperate to work off the massive debt her father has placed their family in. Thankfully, she's locked down a gig as a bodyguard for Ashan, a prince next in line for the sultan's throne in Oman. But when assassin after assassin is deployed to take him out, Seo-Yoon starts doubting her ability to stick it out for the year she's been contracted for.\n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes 5 side stories and 9 special chapters*",
